<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez WI Carr sets Beijing Ent warrant.</title>
<headline>Indosuez WI Carr sets Beijing Ent warrant.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Friday it plans to issue 84 million American-style call warrants on shares of Beijing Enterprises Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$42	    PREMIUM	 22.05 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.9261	GEARING	 4.54x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  28.NOV.97	EXER LOT	20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$42</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
